;opacity:0">Frequently Asked Question</h2></div><div class="section-content home-faq"><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="bdc72a97-a17f-b144-f74b-256afbef2910" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="faq-accordion w-dropdown"><div class="accordion-label w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="faq-label-title">What do we do as a property management company?</div><div class="faq-label-icon"><div class="faq-icon-bar"></div><div class="faq-icon-bar _2"></div></div></div><nav class="accordion-pane w-dropdown-list"><p class="faq-accordion-details-text">We handle everything from finding and screening tenants to collecting rent, managing maintenance, conducting inspections, and dealing with any issues that come up—so you don’t have to.</p></nav></div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="27b8e578-aeed-c133-1c39-b62bd0073fac" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="faq-accordion w-dropdown"><div class="accordion-label w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="faq-label-title">How do you screen tenants?</div><div class="faq-label-icon"><div class="faq-icon-bar"></div><div class="faq-icon-bar _2"></div></div></div><nav class="accordion-pane w-dropdown-list"><p class="faq-accordion-details-text">We use a thorough process that includes background checks, credit reports, employment verification, and references to find reliable, responsible tenants.</p></nav></div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="1a8277c2-2bb0-3f2d-0c25-de178d6034b1" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="faq-accordion w-dropdown"><div class="accordion-label w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="faq-label-title">How often do you inspect the property?</div><div class="faq-label-icon"><div class="faq-icon-bar"></div><div class="faq-icon-bar _2"></div></div></div><nav class="accordion-pane w-dropdown-list"><p class="faq-accordion-details-text">We conduct regular inspections—both scheduled and as needed—to ensure your property stays in great condition and any issues are addressed early.</p></nav></div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="dd62aefd-caa9-005b-5283-42a9d2003f68" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="faq-accordion w-dropdown"><div class="accordion-label w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="faq-label-title">How are maintenance requests handled?</div><div class="faq-label-icon"><div class="faq-icon-bar"></div><div class="faq-icon-bar _2"></div></div></div><nav class="accordion-pane w-dropdown-list"><p class="faq-accordion-details-text">Tenants can submit maintenance requests 24/7. We work with trusted local vendors to take care of repairs promptly and at fair prices.</p></nav></div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="65f2257d-62aa-174a-3242-36b927fc351e" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="faq-accordion w-dropdown"><div class="accordion-label w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="faq-label-title">What types of properties do you manage?</div><div class="faq-label-icon"><div class="faq-icon-bar"></div><div class="faq-icon-bar _2"></div></div></div><nav class="accordion-pane w-dropdown-list"><p class="faq-accordion-details-text">We manage single-family homes, condos, townhomes, and short-term rental properties.</p></nav></div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="e7074bab-aa62-5ba6-eb7d-0d6fc21d7b6d" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="faq-accordion w-dropdown"><div class="accordion-label w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="faq-label-title">How do you handle rent collection and late payments?</div><div class="faq-label-icon"><div class="faq-icon-bar"></div><div class="faq-icon-bar _2"></div></div></div><nav class="accordion-pane w-dropdown-list"><p class="faq-accordion-details-text">We collect rent electronically and have a clear late-payment policy in place to keep things running smoothly.</p></nav></div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="a379961f-007f-7485-e037-69e509d72fee" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="faq-accordion w-dropdown"><div class="accordion-label w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="faq-label-title">Can I still be involved in decisions about my property?</div><div class="faq-label-icon"><div class="faq-icon-bar"></div><div class="faq-icon-bar _2"></div></div></div><nav class="accordion-pane w-dropdown-list"><p class="faq-accordion-details-text">Absolutely! We’ll always consult you for major decisions—your property, your rules. We’re just here to make life easier.</p></nav></div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="60432b0d-5cec-6fe0-7f00-d50646d5f3b0" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="faq-accordion w-dropdown"><div class="accordion-label w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="faq-label-title">How much do your property management services cost?</div><div class="faq-label-icon"><div class="faq-icon-bar"></div><div class="faq-icon-bar _2"></div></div></div><nav class="accordion-pane w-dropdown-list"><p class="faq-accordion-details-text">Our pricing is competitive and transparent. Contact us for a custom quote b